  "prefLabel": "Plc 305.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 305.01 Purpose. The purpose of the rules in Plc 305 is to implement RSA 310:6, V relative to temporary licensure of health care professionals and RSA 332-G:14 relative to temporary licensing of professionals licensed under Title XXX and the trades, professions, and businesses regulated by the mechanical licensing board under RSA 153:27 through RSA 153:38.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 300) #13606, eff 5-1-23; ss by #13955, eff 5-3-24 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 300)",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc300.html"
